{
 "fps": 30,
 "frames": 2023,
 "dur": 67.423,
 "target": 64.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Why did 73-year-old Alvin Straight ride a lawnmower 240 miles?",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 4.394
  },
  {
   "text": "Top speed: five miles an hour, towing a little trailer with his bed inside.",
   "s": 4.694,
   "e": 8.283
  },
  {
   "text": "His brother Henry is sick, far away in Wisconsin, and they haven't spoken in ten years.",
   "s": 8.483,
   "e": 12.738
  },
  {
   "text": "Alvin's eyes are too weak to drive a car, and he won't take a bus.",
   "s": 12.938,
   "e": 16.124
  },
  {
   "text": "So he hitches his trailer to an old mower and putters onto the highway.",
   "s": 16.324,
   "e": 19.476
  },
  {
   "text": "Trucks roar past him. Neighbors shake their heads. Even the cows stare.",
   "s": 19.676,
   "e": 22.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, a few days out, the mower coughs, smokes, and dies.",
   "s": 22.9,
   "e": 25.256
  },
  {
   "text": "Alvin gets towed home. Everyone says he's done.",
   "s": 25.456,
   "e": 27.539
  },
  {
   "text": "But Alvin buys another old mower for three hundred dollars and starts again.",
   "s": 27.739,
   "e": 31.522
  },
  {
   "text": "Rain soaks him, the sun bakes him, and then his money runs out!",
   "s": 31.722,
   "e": 33.905
  },
  {
   "text": "So he camps beside the road for days, waiting for his pension check.",
   "s": 34.105,
   "e": 37.385
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it gets worse. The new mower breaks down on a hill, miles from anywhere.",
   "s": 37.585,
   "e": 40.924
  },
  {
   "text": "Strangers stop. A farmer fixes the engine. A family feeds him supper.",
   "s": 41.124,
   "e": 44.795
  },
  {
   "text": "Six weeks later, a tiny mower rolls up to a farmhouse in Wisconsin.",
   "s": 44.995,
   "e": 48.418
  },
  {
   "text": "Henry steps outside, sees the mower, and can't say a word.",
   "s": 48.818,
   "e": 51.432
  },
  {
   "text": "Because Alvin had to come by himself. Ten years of silence needed one slow, stubborn trip.",
   "s": 51.632,
   "e": 56.41
  },
  {
   "text": "The two brothers sit on the porch together, and nobody needs to talk.",
   "s": 56.61,
   "e": 59.826
  },
  {
   "text": "And that's why an old man rode a lawnmower 240 miles.",
   "s": 60.026,
   "e": 63.516
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow for a weird story every day. Like this one:",
   "s": 63.716,
   "e": 66.123
  }
 ],
